        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️ The truth behind a chain of mysterious cases awaits your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the edge between dreams and reality, you will step into the role of an investigator, drawn into a series of puzzling and interwoven cases. From bizarre murders in nightmares to disappearances and crimes surfacing in reality, every clue hides a deeper secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Detective Experience:</strong><br>Case files, suspect photos, and crime scenes are all pieced together by your own hands. Every detail may lead to a breakthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Cases:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Nightmare Murder Case</i>: Is the suspect from the dream connected to reality?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Wen Kai Affair</i>: A seemingly ordinary commission conceals a larger mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Wen Wan Murder</i>: The truth behind a missing girl—who is pulling the strings?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Scene Exploration:</strong><br>Secret meetings in cafés, mysterious bodies under artificial rocks, and hidden hospital records—each step of the investigation brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Character Network:</strong><br>Zhang Meiqi, Lu Yunyun, Liu Gangqiang… Are they just ordinary people, or the key to uncovering the truth? Only careful observation can expose their disguises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles and Deduction:</strong><br>Use photos, notebooks, medical files, locker codes, and more to reconstruct the killer’s motives and identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you untangle these cases and uncover the one true answer?<br>Every deduction tests your logic and observation skills. The truth belongs only to the sharpest detectives.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️ The truth behind a chain of mysterious cases awaits your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the edge between dreams and reality, you will step into the role of an investigator, drawn into a series of puzzling and interwoven cases. From bizarre murders in nightmares to disappearances and crimes surfacing in reality, every clue hides a deeper secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Detective Experience:</strong><br>Case files, suspect photos, and crime scenes are all pieced together by your own hands. Every detail may lead to a breakthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Cases:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Nightmare Murder Case</i>: Is the suspect from the dream connected to reality?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Wen Kai Affair</i>: A seemingly ordinary commission conceals a larger mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Wen Wan Murder</i>: The truth behind a missing girl—who is pulling the strings?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Scene Exploration:</strong><br>Secret meetings in cafés, mysterious bodies under artificial rocks, and hidden hospital records—each step of the investigation brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Character Network:</strong><br>Zhang Meiqi, Lu Yunyun, Liu Gangqiang… Are they just ordinary people, or the key to uncovering the truth? Only careful observation can expose their disguises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles and Deduction:</strong><br>Use photos, notebooks, medical files, locker codes, and more to reconstruct the killer’s motives and identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you untangle these cases and uncover the one true answer?<br>Every deduction tests your logic and observation skills. The truth belongs only to the sharpest detectives.</p>",
        "short_description": "A suspenseful detective puzzle game where players investigate cases woven between dreams and reality. Collect clues, examine evidence, and explore scenes to unravel the truth. Each case is interconnected, suspects are complex, and every deduction may reshape your understanding of the mystery.",
